{"aihot_items":[{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0mqceo08lzro2o6xi3rlk4","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"cmt0mqceo08lzro2o6xi3rlk4","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0mqceo08lzro2o6xi3rlk4","published_at":"2026-08-19T21:42:09.969000Z","ref":"A1","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"Hacker News 热门（buzzing.cc 中文翻译）","summary":"Anthropic 因 OpenAI-Hugging Face 事件及即将推出的 Astra 模型可能达到\"关键网络安全能力阈值\"，暂时放缓模型扩展速度，包括暂停最新模型两周的强化学习（RL）训练。公司已加强研究环境安全要求，包括工作负载隔离、网络隔离和持续安全测试，并扩大思维链监控范围。涉及 Astra 或网络模型的工作负载需满足最严格安全标准，部分训练和评估工作仍处于暂停状态。","title":"Anthropic 在网络关键能力时代放缓模型开发：暂停 RL 训练并强化安全防护","title_en":"在网络关键能力时代推进模型开发","url":"https://openai.com/index/pacing-model-development-cyber-capabilities"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0kxcuu07f2ro2owuqpbjc8","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmt0kxcuu07f2ro2owuqpbjc8","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0kxcuu07f2ro2owuqpbjc8","published_at":"2026-08-19T20:42:57Z","ref":"A2","score":71,"selected":true,"source":"X：Sky Computing Lab (@haoailab)","summary":"一段 5 秒 480P 视频，完全在 Mac 上生成，耗时 30 秒。无需 CUDA，无需云端，仅占用 3.9 GiB 内存。\n\nFastMetal 将 FastWan-QAD 系列带到 Apple Silicon。DiT、DMD 采样器和解码器均通过 MLX 在 Metal 上运行，默认 INT8。\n\n三个模型：1.3B 支持 480P，5B 支持 720P，14B 追求画质。\n\n📷 博客：http://haoailab.com/blogs/fastmetal 📷 代码：http://github.com/hao-ai-lab/FastVideo 📷 模型：http://huggingface.co/collections/FastVideo/fastmetal","title":"FastMetal 让 Mac 本地 30 秒生成视频","title_en":"A 5-second 480P video， generated entirely on a Mac， in 30 seconds. No CUDA， no cloud， 3.9 GiB of mem…","url":"https://x.com/haoailab/status/2090177721913770407"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0e7sxo01eiro2o4l4y9jmh","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cmt0e7sxo01eiro2o4l4y9jmh","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt0e7sxo01eiro2o4l4y9jmh","published_at":"2026-08-19T17:56:13.817000Z","ref":"A3","score":73,"selected":true,"source":"LMSYS：Blog（Chatbot Arena 团队）","summary":"LMSYS 团队针对 1.6 万亿参数的 MoE 模型 DeepSeek-V4-Pro，在 H20 GPU 上通过场景化服务配置逼近 B300 性能。单节点 H20-141GB 参考实现达 271 output tokens/s，与 B300 的 383.7 tokens/s 性能差距缩小至 1.42×。","title":"突破 DeepSeek-V4-Pro 服务极限：H20 上的多场景优化方法","title_en":"Blog Pushing the Limits of Serving DeepSeek-V4-Pro DeepSeek-V4-Pro is a 1.6-trillion-parameter Mixture-of-Experts （MoE） model released with both FP8 and FP4 weights. Models at this scale naturally benefit from accelerators such as NVIDIA Blackwell GPU… Tianyu Zhang， Yusong Gao， Yun Zhang","url":"https://www.lmsys.org/blog/2026-08-19-deepseek-v4-pro-engine-optimization-h20"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt05zhyg139trodp6bxsy9e2","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"cmt05zhyg139trodp6bxsy9e2","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmt05zhyg139trodp6bxsy9e2","published_at":"2026-08-19T13:48:49Z","ref":"A4","score":64,"selected":true,"source":"Hugging Face：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Liquid AI 发布基于量化感知蒸馏（QAD）训练的 LFM2.5-230M、350M、1.2B-Instruct 和 2.6B 四款 Q4_0 GGUF 检查点，在保持原生 Q4_0 内存与速度的同时，恢复 BF16 平均精度损失的 97%。","title":"Liquid AI 发布 LFM2.5 系列 QAD Q4_0 量化检查点，恢复 97% 精度损失","title_en":"LFM2.5 Q4\\_0 Checkpoints from Quantization-Aware Distillation","url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/LiquidAI/qad"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmszeb2mx0b3srodpef1ub0j0","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"cmszeb2mx0b3srodpef1ub0j0","permalink":"https://aihot.virxact.com/items/cmszeb2mx0b3srodpef1ub0j0","published_at":"2026-08-19T01:03:29Z","ref":"A5","score":79,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：智谱（GLM）","summary":"GLM-5.3 API即日上线，擅长复杂编码、防御性网络安全与长程任务，在AA综合智能指数中取得60分，与Claude Fable 5、GPT-5.6 Sol等闭源旗舰同级，并与Kimi K3并列开源模型第一。该模型以更小参数规模和更低调用成本降低前沿智能门槛，单任务成本为旗舰模型中最低。API定价与GLM-5.2持平，模型权重将于下周五开源。","title":"GLM-5.3上线：AA智能指数60分并列开源第一，成本更低","title_en":"GLM-5.3上线：拓展智能上界的可及边界","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzI3NzQ0Mg%3D%3D&mid=2247494105&idx=1&sn=8d7409e0fb846a3c7803c142b5d1a8e7